    'CPR and choking for every age, allergic reactions, bleeding, heart attack and stroke, a full babies-and-children section, snakes and marine life, and how to actually get help here. Checked against named medical authorities — see its own sources.': '涵盖各年龄段的心肺复苏和噎食急救、过敏反应、出血、心脏病发作和中风，还有完整的婴幼儿部分、蛇类和海洋生物，以及在当地如何真正获得帮助。内容已对照有名可查的医疗权威机构核对，详见其自带的来源。',
    'Checked hospitals with a 24-hour emergency department come first (children’s care first for a family), then straight-line distance. Closer places from OpenStreetMap follow, unchecked. The full screen has the rest of the country, what to do where nothing is listed, how people reach a hospital here, and your medical card.': '经核实、设有 24 小时急诊科的医院排在最前（带家人同行时优先显示儿童诊疗），然后按直线距离排序。其后是来自 OpenStreetMap、尚未核实的较近地点。完整页面还有全国其他地区、无任何地点可选时该怎么办、当地人如何前往医院，以及您的医疗卡。',
    'Choose accommodation with strong recent reviews and 24-hour reception; a door that locks from the inside, and a padlock for hostel lockers, are worth it.': '请选择近期评价良好、设有 24 小时前台的住宿；房门可从内侧锁上，并自备一把用于青旅储物柜的挂锁，都很值得。',
