    'Downloads each language’s pronunciations from an online voice once, so the phrasebook’s speaker then works with no signal. There is one audio quality — the online voice does not offer a choice. Lao has no online voice to download from at all yet (tracked separately); this app’s other phrasebook languages already have a voice built into most phones, so a downloaded pack would not buy them anything.': '从在线语音服务一次性下载每种语言的发音，之后常用语手册的朗读无需信号即可使用。音质只有一种，在线语音不提供选择。老挝语目前还没有可供下载的在线语音（另行跟进）；本应用的其他常用语手册语言，大多数手机已内置语音，因此下载语音包对它们没有帮助。',
